# Rust
/target/
**/target/
Cargo.lock.bak

# Qt / C++ build
/build/
**/build/
*.user
*.o
*.obj
moc_*.cpp
qrc_*.cpp
ui_*.h
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/

# Vendored engine build artifacts (keep source refs, ignore outputs)
/third_party/**/out/

# Provisioned veraPDF (test-environment only; never shipped). [ADR-022 §6]
/third_party/verapdf/

# Provisioned engine binaries. SDS §13.4 fetches these with a setup step, so
# only third_party/pdfium/provenance.toml is committed. [ADR-028 §3]
/third_party/pdfium/prebuilt/

# Node (tooling)
node_modules/

# Python (tools/ gate scripts leave bytecode caches)
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Agent session state (ephemeral, not committed)
.agent-state/
.swarm/
# Agent tooling scratch. These are one contributor's local tool state, not
# project artifacts: nothing in the repository reads them, and .serena's
# memories carried a stale status claim ("M0-M7 complete", "232 passing") that
# was wrong and published. Keep the tools; keep their state out of the repo.
.serena/
.mimocode/
.claude/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
# Local vector/index caches — may contain indexed source; never commit (GIT-5)
ruvector.db
.codebase-memory/

# Secrets - never commit
*.pem
*.key
.env
*.local
